  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "FIXED\n\t\t\t* A project Description written on several indented lines heads the specification as one line\n\t\t\t* Returns computed from two to five arguments renders as \"returns (a, b) => body\" instead of rendering no answer\n\t\t\t* A lambda with typed parameters no longer makes the claim in the same chain render as raw source\n\t\t\t* A tap is described like the rest of its Given instead of written as its source\n\t\t\t* A tuple in the subject and return type header is written as C# writes it, with the element names the spec declared",
